      "source_sha256": "bca052c42781eafe29115cd421cd1602aa12360ef4c0912b65840cb1ca7d117c",
      "target": "# 发现人们实际执行的工作流\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0002",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform"
      ],
      "ordinal": 1,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0003",
      "kind": "blockquote",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "3d8e10aeaada69ada8534219d54978bc38cf330be88405d8d87a6160e9ed5df7",
      "target": "> 需求并不是现成地摆在会议中，等着你去收集。它们分散在行动、变通做法（workaround）、记录与分歧之中。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0004",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform"
      ],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "source_sha256": "d901a6aaef0820c4027b68e2a7745eb8f24f2117bed325332d30ea2b53a775d3",
      "target": "**Type:** Learn + Build\n**Languages:** Python (stdlib)\n**Prerequisites:** 第 14 阶段第 47 课\n**Time:** ~70 分钟\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0006",
      "kind": "separator",
