    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "584e52d24f2b17886a76212978741fa03ba6bc6aa292a0331b41402490b42267",
      "target": "## 学习目标\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0008",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0009",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "fa8f75a50715bc4388c1b61d0601dc681a5d968c0dc2bab47684190d9711d1e0",
      "target": "- 将当前工作流（workflow）建模为有证据支撑的有序行动。\n- 区分直接观察（direct observation）与人们陈述的行为（reported behavior）或推断出的行为。\n- 找出阻力（friction）、交接（handoff）、权限归属（authority）与隐性状态（hidden state）。\n- 让不确定的主张保持可见，而不是将其变成需求。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0010",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Learning Objectives"
      ],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Start with the Current System"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "c43d36e3ab9da6ccfb37355ab18cc59973fa216608d372d06f53cf0c6c8a34eb",
      "target": "## 从当前系统入手\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0012",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Start with the Current System"
      ],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Start with the Current System"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "a8c6659c59e90bfb3a0dcce47e3c08df40924880ce3dcf79831dd8ae4f609c52",
      "target": "不要一开始就问人们想要什么功能。先重建当前实际发生的过程。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0014",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Start with the Current System"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Start with the Current System"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "77a12cc7f545f737fddd6e7745705813e2e8857ebe6a05024f1bf5ed4477c35a",
      "target": "针对每个步骤，记录以下内容：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0016",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Start with the Current System"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0017",
      "kind": "table",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Start with the Current System"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "e279271e3989f20c4495e4e618b565f2ce3c1607168440622e9341aa2b45a856",
      "target": "| 字段 | 示例 |\n|---|---|\n| 执行者（actor） | 值班工程师 |\n| 触发条件（trigger） | 收到生产环境告警 |\n| 行动 | 打开告警，然后搜索仪表板 |\n| 输入 | 告警载荷与部署记录（deployment record） |\n| 产出 | 候选服务及其负责人 |\n| 阻力 | 在三种工具之间进行上下文切换（context switching） |\n| 权限归属 | 事件指挥员批准写入操作 |\n| 证据 | 屏幕录制、事件日志、操作手册（runbook） |\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0018",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Start with the Current System"
      ],
      "ordinal": 9,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Start with the Current System"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "675ddee9a433ccdc9271005eb1800209ac759fce9089cad5758ef0bc68ba3f91",
      "target": "工作流的范围不止屏幕上看到的内容。它还包括等待、复制粘贴、非正式沟通渠道（side channel）、审批、错误恢复，以及人们已经习以为常、不再留意的步骤。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0020",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Start with the Current System"
      ],
      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Evidence Has Strength"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "06f950c0f37bface2e1092ab6525de47e3423eeda5d521c5b62b6ebafb1fc928",
      "target": "## 证据有强弱之分\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0022",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Evidence Has Strength"
      ],
      "ordinal": 11,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Evidence Has Strength"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "e13ee8729b6e4d3360c765f4e40222da3284aac3d068ab47bcc43f4c04a262e9",
      "target": "采用一个简单的证据层级（evidence ladder）：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0024",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Evidence Has Strength"
      ],
      "ordinal": 12,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0025",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Evidence Has Strength"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "a44d446282c74c729ecbe6d0a0e8fead943f5454f52986f26a70fe3b78a61b73",
      "target": "1. **直接行为证据（direct behavior）：** 观察、行为轨迹（trace）、录制记录或系统事件。\n2. **产物（artifact）：** 工单、操作手册、日志、表单或已经完成的产出。\n3. **陈述的行为：** 某人描述自己如何行动。\n4. **推断（inference）：** 团队对可能发生的事情作出判断。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0026",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Evidence Has Strength"
      ],
      "ordinal": 13,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Evidence Has Strength"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "854e2bbff53b926d99a3e72b1311c6819f191a7afaa9100c61493e440979b6ec",
      "target": "这四类证据都可能有用。只有前两类能直接证明当前行为。为其余类别做好标注，避免置信度（confidence）在不知不觉中被拔高。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0028",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Evidence Has Strength"
      ],
      "ordinal": 14,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0029",
      "kind": "fence",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Evidence Has Strength"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "7d5c55a4f2528b6826efed3cc6f76186a0d0ed3cfbcbccb7a0eb4a980e6033ac",
      "target": "```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  T[Trigger] --> A1[Actor action]\n  A1 --> H[Handoff]\n  H --> A2[Next actor action]\n  A2 --> O[Outcome]\n  E1[Direct evidence] -.supports.-> A1\n  E2[Artifact] -.supports.-> H\n  E3[Reported behavior] -.supports.-> A2\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0030",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Evidence Has Strength"
      ],
      "ordinal": 15,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
