      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "85b2ada04b32042f3cbcf703901c975c81c6ecebaba16c67f10a77f00c537260",
      "target": "- **阻力：** 重复劳动、延迟、重复录入或恢复。\n- **隐性状态：** 存在于记忆、聊天或个人笔记中的事实。\n- **权限归属：** 获准作出有重要影响的变更的人或系统。\n- **例外情况（exception）：** 正常工作流不再按常态运行的情况。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0034",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Search for Four Things"
      ],
      "ordinal": 17,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Search for Four Things"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "665db92c47f9cc45051be3d35522dfe113b4f8f64619e8a4693a7a1b5cf85d66",
      "target": "AI 功能经常在交接和例外情况下失效，因为设计时只考虑了正常路径（happy path）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0036",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Search for Four Things"
      ],
      "ordinal": 18,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Do Not Average Away Disagreement"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "c40561d6ed3a07d7f94a4e52b3aacbf2ee77fbfa854fb1bb42592ac2b5a1bce4",
      "target": "## 不要用平均值抹去分歧\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0038",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Do Not Average Away Disagreement"
      ],
      "ordinal": 19,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Do Not Average Away Disagreement"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "e8ff946b43757a40e42fe0f6172b62e1dc04f65331e683b4c1a6d0789d246deb",
      "target": "两个用户采用不同的工作流，可能各有合理的原因。先保留这些工作流变体（workflow variant），直到你弄清楚它们是否反映了以下差异：\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0040",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Do Not Average Away Disagreement"
      ],
      "ordinal": 20,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0041",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Do Not Average Away Disagreement"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "6718a7f292b5e95d8fb105da201d4e6c256a58c6656e72b38685a9fc0b64c01b",
      "target": "- 角色不同；\n- 风险等级不同；\n- 旧流程与当前流程的区别；\n- 专业水平不同；\n- 真正存在的政策分歧。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0042",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Do Not Average Away Disagreement"
      ],
      "ordinal": 21,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Do Not Average Away Disagreement"
      ],
      "ordinal": 22,
      "source_sha256": "16e46490d886e60c876d747acd280f2f860e32fce9880fe7ab1151d13036cbab",
      "target": "取平均后得到的工作流，可能不符合任何人的实际做法。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0044",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Do Not Average Away Disagreement"
