      "target": "## 练习\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0054",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 27,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0055",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Exercises"
      ],
      "ordinal": 28,
      "source_sha256": "df22e2fb07afa364078e63e422dd3be94c10d4cbfdae11f95f072ea1b17a4443",
      "target": "1. 不采访任何人，仅依据一份日志重建一个工作流。\n2. 采访一位用户，标出每一条仍缺少直接证据的主张。\n3. 添加一个权限边界和一个故障恢复步骤。\n4. 为两个工作流变体分别建模，不要将它们合并。\n5. 找出一项拟议功能：它移除了一个可见步骤，却没有触及隐性工作。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0056",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
