    },
    {
      "segment_id": "14-48:b0059",
      "kind": "list",
      "heading_path": [
        "# Discover the Workflow People Actually Perform",
        "## Further Reading"
      ],
      "ordinal": 30,
      "source_sha256": "ab3d9549e480143330a22a8beca9d01d750333b7b4ddd482020afee7e6c7e713",
      "target": "- [Nuseibeh and Easterbrook, Requirements Engineering: A Roadmap](https://www.cs.toronto.edu/~sme/papers/2000/ICSE2000.pdf)，重点关注它如何将需求获取（elicitation）视为解释、建模与验证，而非简单的收集。\n- [Gotel and Finkelstein, An Analysis of the Requirements Traceability Problem](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICRE.1994.292398)，了解维系需求与其来源之间关系的难点。\n"
    },
    {
